From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:36:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/11] ARM: dts: sun8i: a33: ga36: move the buttons to the
 gamepad

The stick MCU on UART1 and the GPIO buttons are one gamepad. Move the
buttons from gpio-keys to the gamepad node under UART1.

Signed-off-by: Bepok <wojtekjakubiszyn@gmail.com>
---
